### Test API endpoints

### Get all users
GET https://localhost:7024/api/user
Accept: application/json

### Get user by ID
GET https://localhost:7024/api/user/1
Accept: application/json

### Add new user
POST https://localhost:7024/api/user/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "John Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Update user
PUT https://localhost:7024/api/user/update
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "fullName": "John Smith",
  "email": "john.smith@example.com",
  "isActive": true
}

### Login user
POST https://localhost:7024/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Delete user
DELETE https://localhost:7024/api/user/1
Accept: application/json
